	(footprint "picoemp:D_SOD-123FL"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "fb87d72b-bdfd-4bb7-b644-bc3819b0a470")
		(at 131.25 95.5 180)
		(descr "MCC SOD-123FL (flat lead), e.g. SM4005PL-TP. Pad centres at +/-1.55mm (3.10mm span), size 1.15x1.3mm -- copied from the as-fabricated main:DSS13UTR footprint used for D1 on the original board (a SOD-123FL rectifier), and cross-checked against Central Semiconductor's own SOD-123FL mounting-pad drawing (4.1mm overall pad-to-pad envelope minus a 0.95mm pad width = 3.15mm centre span, within 0.05mm). An earlier draft of this footprint used MCC's suggested-pad-layout figure at 2.36mm; that number turned out to be the INNER-EDGE gap between pads, not the centre-to-centre span, so the earlier pads landed short of the body outline entirely. KiCad's stock Diode_SMD:D_SOD-123F uses a 2.8mm pad span (1.1x1.1mm square pads), which is still off this package's real geometry; use this footprint instead for SOD-123FL parts.")
		(tags "diode SOD-123FL SOD123FL flat lead")
